    {
      "hook": "Automated Oversight for the Novandino Litio Expansion",
      "finding_ids": [
        "F01",
        "F09",
        "F12",
        "F18"
      ],
      "how_to_say_it": "With the Supreme Court confirming the Novandino partnership and a US$3B investment to increase lithium production by 70%, FlytBase provides the scalable, pilot-free infrastructure needed to monitor this massive expansion in the Atacama without a proportional increase in high-cost contractor crews."
    },
    {
      "hook": "Safety-First Risk Mitigation for Remote Operations",
      "finding_ids": [
        "F07",
        "F08",
        "F26"
      ],
      "how_to_say_it": "Given that SQM identifies operational stoppages from safety incidents as a major risk, and currently manages over 2,700 contractors in remote areas, our autonomous docks remove humans from hazardous environments while providing 24/7 emergency response and safety monitoring."
    },
